        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-audit-v2-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-audit-v2-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-2>,
