<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grieneisen et al. (2007) Nature & Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature reverse-fountain root tip auxin reflux capacitor, Quiescent Center exponential accumulation, and PLETHORA meristem zonality — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the 2D 5-tissue radial-axial root tip reflux capacitor and PLETHORA zonality solver (`verify_vascular_epidermal_reflux_conservation`, `simulate_2d_root_reflux_lattice`, `run_six_perturbation_regimes`, L107-464) covering stele, pericycle/endodermis, cortex, epidermis/LRC, and columella/QC across all 6 canonical regimes (WT, shoot decapitation, pin2/eir1, lateral-PIN ablation, NPA blockade, and QC laser ablation), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_038_root_auxin_reflux_fountain.lean`." ;
