<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grieneisen et al. (2007) Nature & Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature reverse-fountain root tip auxin reflux capacitor, Quiescent Center exponential accumulation, and PLETHORA meristem zonality — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L556-670) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty, Pearson r/p-values, and negative controls: counter-current flux conservation error 2e-15 (ref 0.0), WT QC amplification 132.05x (ref 142.5x, r = 1.0, vs 1.31x in NPA and 10.38x in k_lat=0), shoot decapitation autonomous retention 115.56x (87.5% of WT), QC laser-ablation regenerated peak at z = 97.5 um (+60 um proximal shift from 37.5 um), WT PLETHORA meristem boundary z_MZ = 300.0 um (vs 210 um in pin2, 90 um in k_lat=0, 0 um in NPA), 6-regime meristem boundary Pearson r = 0.9929 (p = 7.47e-5), and 3 empirical confocal root meristem metrics (113 DAPI nuclei, 18.3394 +- 0.5790 px spacing, apical/proximal density ratio 1.1182)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-qc-laser-ablation-regenerated-peak-z-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-shoot-decapitation-capacitor-retention-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-six-regime-meristem-boundary-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-specimen-apical-to-proximal-nuclear-density-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-specimen-detected-meristem-nuclei-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-specimen-intercellular-nuclear-spacing-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-vascular-epidermal-counter-current-flux-error>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-measurement-wt-plethora-meristem-zone-boundary-um>,
